# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT FOR A PUBLIC REPO
#
# GitHub Pages is free only on a public repository, and a public repository
# publishes everything in it — not just the page. These are excluded because
# they should not be on the open internet:
#
#   sample docuemnts/   medical referral forms. The data in them is invented,
#                       but they are shaped like real patient records (PESEL,
#                       name, address, employer) and they are not ours to
#                       publish. Also contains the manager's internal mockup.
#   main project...     the internal spec for the backend system.
#
# The app does NOT need any of this to run — it is test material.
# If the repo is private (Pages needs GitHub Pro, or use Cloudflare Pages,
# which serves private repos for free), delete these two lines.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
sample docuemnts/
main project documentation

